{"title":"Titanium Scimitar","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Weapon Smithing Lv 52) · Monster drop: Ogre Charger, Warchief Ruk Gorehand, Gutrot The Carver, Ogre Elder, Virikh +16 more</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 40 · STR 100 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>Skill needed</h2><p>Wielding it takes the <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\"><b>Sword</b> weapon skill</a>. <b>Warriors</b> start with it. Everyone else can study a <b>Sword tome</b> (1 skill point; vendors no longer sell them, so look on the Exchange).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\">Weapon skills &amp; specials</a> for how the skill levels and what it unlocks.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Weapon Smithing at level 52 <span class=\"muted\">(4676 XP)</span> from 5× <a href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\">Titanium Bar</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"rimeworm-elder\" title=\"Hollowtooth - dropped it in 1 of 1 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/0047941c3282c0f339ca.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Hollowtooth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"lantern-eater\" title=\"The Lantern Eater - dropped it in 1 of 7 looted corpses (1/7)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c92787d8673dbae51c75.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">The Lantern Eater</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-warchief\" title=\"Warchief Ruk Gorehand - dropped it in 12 of 184 looted corpses (1/15)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9fdec8d1ac3c9d7ac8df.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Warchief Ruk Gorehand</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/15<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-carver\" title=\"Gutrot The Carver - dropped it in 12 of 185 looted corpses (1/15)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/1f884f2242ac6c9d138c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gutrot The Carver</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/15<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+17 more\">+17 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh-dragonslayer\" title=\"Virikh Dragonslayer - dropped it in 2 of 32 looted corpses (1/16)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/7d40b95a4d9390b47b9c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh Dragonslayer</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/16<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh\" title=\"Virikh - dropped it in 8 of 197 looted corpses (1/25)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4dbed39ea4505123159.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/25<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-firespeaker\" title=\"Old Mother Ashka - dropped it in 7 of 184 looted corpses (1/26)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c9d4aa1be4f688f3b580.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Old Mother Ashka</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/26<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-unmoved\" title=\"Kragg The Unmoved - dropped it in 6 of 183 looted corpses (1/31)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/0dd1fe765b90d83e2fba.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Kragg The Unmoved</span><span class=\"entity-chi